Data in this directory:
- corpus_src.py and the corpus.json / queries.json it generates: synthetic, written for this repository, describing a fictional
  organisation. Dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
- embeddings.json: vectors computed from that corpus with sentence-transformers/paraphrase-multilingual-MiniLM-L12-v2 (Apache-2.0).
- traces_*.jsonl: recorded runs of the pipeline. They contain the queries, rerank scores from BAAI/bge-reranker-base (MIT) or, in
  traces_opencode_jina_*, from jinaai/jina-reranker-v2-base-multilingual (model licensed CC-BY-NC-4.0), and answers generated by a free OpenCode model. Released under CC0 as far as the repository author holds rights.
- rerank_rankings.json: recorded top-10 rerank results per query from BAAI/bge-reranker-base (MIT) and jinaai/jina-reranker-v2-base-multilingual
  (CC-BY-NC-4.0), used by the tests. CC0 only as far as the repository author holds rights.
